  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Tell me, tell me somethin' that I don't know already",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "'Cause, baby, you can talk in circles for hours",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Make a good day sour",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Then you look me, look me, straight into my eyes",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Say that you're sorry",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "How could I not believe in you?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "You said it was safe to do",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "We both know this happens every time, every time",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "You tell me a lie, I'll tell you five, uh",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Which one of us today is gonna cry, gonna cry?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Back and forth, we're goin' at it, burnin' it alive",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You're the only one who can boil my blood",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "And make that shit cut",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "'Cause you know that I'm always yours",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I'm so in love",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "It's a punch to the gut, could never be done",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Still, I'm always wantin' more",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "post-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You say that I'm a mess, oh",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Just wait till I make it hurt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "'Cause, babe, last time I checked",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "The two of us were messier, er-er, er-er-er",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "We're messier, er-er, er-er-er",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Oh, why'd you say that?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Can't believe you thought it's fine to say that",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Couldn't care less for one second",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Now you're all possessive",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "So I'm walkin' out, sayin', \"I'm so done\"",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "And you're lookin' like a fool in the restaurant",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "You're runnin' outside, you're pullin' my arm",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Not sure if my mom would call this love",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
